      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "content": "# Polaris ClickHouse\n\n**v1 posture.** Polaris does **not** scrape ClickHouse natively in v1 (the `clickhouse` service in `docker-compose.yml` does not expose `/metrics`). The dashboard's signals come from two places: the **analytics-projector** processor (Polaris's canonical ClickHouse inserter) and the projector's **probe poller** (PI2CRFZC), which periodically queries ClickHouse `system.*` views and re-publishes the rows as Polaris gauges.\n\n**Available metrics**:\n\n- `polaris_clickhouse_kafka_ingestion_lag_seconds{database, table}` — Kafka-engine consumer lag, from `system.kafka_consumers` (PI2CRFZC).\n- `polaris_clickhouse_mv_state{view, state}` — materialized-view state, from `system.materialized_views` (PI2CRFZC). `state=\"failed\"` powers the page alert.\n- `polaris_processor_lag_ms_last{processor_name=\"analytics-projector\"}` — proxy for the Kafka→analytics insert lag at the inserter.\n- `polaris_processor_events_consumed_total{processor_name=\"analytics-projector\"}` — rate of rows landing in `analytics.events`.\n- `polaris_processor_events_failed_total{processor_name=\"analytics-projector\", reason=...}` — inserter-side failure class.\n- `polaris_processor_events_dlq_total{processor_name=\"analytics-projector\"}` — events DLQ'd after retry exhaustion.\n- `polaris_clickhouse_operator_raw_query_total{caller}` — operator escape-hatch raw queries (audit signal).\n\n**Known gaps**:\n\n- **No native query-rate / query-p99 / parts-count metrics.** These come from `ClickHouseProfileEvents_Query` / `ClickHouseProfileEvents_QueryTimeMicroseconds` and would require either a `clickhouse-exporter` sidecar or extending the probe poller to read `system.metrics`. Not in v1.\n- **No projection-freshness metric.** No v1 emitter for projections like `event-daily-counts`.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.4.0",
      "title": "About this dashboard",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 30000 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 120000 }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "ms"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 8 },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["max"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.4.0",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
          "expr": "max by (partition) (polaris_processor_lag_ms_last{processor_name=\"analytics-projector\", environment=\"$environment\"})",
          "legendFormat": "partition {{partition}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Kafka-engine → analytics insert lag (ms, proxy via analytics-projector)",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 10 },
          "unit": "ops"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 8 },
      "id": 3,
